A(('p', '**Step 3. Compare Luke and Matthew.** Write Luke 15:4–7 and Matthew 18:12–14 in two columns. Mark where each places the ninety and nine, how each describes the loss, what each says after the finding, and what Jesus says at the close. Note what each account has that the other does not.'))
